    <desc lang="fr">In this episode, we focus on nuclear and industrial disasters. Nuclear power, based on fission or fusion, is a clean energy source—but when safety fails, consequences can be catastrophic. Industrial accidents are tragic enough, but when natural disasters like earthquakes or volcanoes strike nuclear facilities, the results can be off the scale and last for decades. This chilling look reminds us that vigilance and responsibility are vital to prevent the unthinkable.</desc>
