    <title>Wonder S1 - "Problems"</title>
    <desc>A lot of problems in this episode. What is the Birthday Problem? Why the Gambler's Ruin debunks the 'luck' factor? And is the union of two sets with infinite elements still be infinity?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261120144842 +0000" stop="20261120152700 +0000">
    <title>Wonder S1 - "Nature’s games"</title>
    <desc>In this episode we learn about Carrion flowers, also called stink or corpse flower. The cuckoo hability to misdirect predators to find nests and how some animals released pheromones to comunicate.</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261120152700 +0000" stop="20261120160517 +0000">
    <title>Wonder S1 - "Perception"</title>
    <desc>Language plays a major role in how people from different parts of the world perceive color. Perspective Illusion is a technique used in illustrations to render scenes and objects in 3 dimensions with depth and</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261120160517 +0000" stop="20261120164335 +0000">
    <title>Wonder S1 - "Phantoms"</title>
    <desc>What is the Body Transfer Illusion or the Moon Illusion? We also explain how the Autokinetic Effect and the Stereoscopy work!</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261120164335 +0000" stop="20261120172153 +0000">
    <title>Wonder S1 - "Art of illusion"</title>
    <desc>How are Rainbows formed? What does it mean to see a Mirage? And when we see a spinning dancer why one can either perceive as spinning clockwise or counter clockwise?</desc>
  </programme>
  
<programme channel="6a1610bebdf296985fd95603-6668b2b5e4f56766e556a413" start="20261120172153 +0000" stop="20261120180010 +0000">
    <title>Wonder S1 - "Phenomenal"</title>
    <desc>In this episode we learn the diference between Iridescence, Chemiluminescence and Bioluminescence. We also learn about Gemstone Coloration and Mechanical Plant Defenses.</desc>
  </programme>
  
